{
  "services": [
    {
      "name": "swap.v1.SwapService",
      "doc": "SwapService converts one asset of an account's Trading balance into another\n through Polyester's spot order books, on the direct market or through USDT\n or USDC, at market or as a TWAP over up to 60 minutes. A Swap\n executes as immediate-or-cancel spot orders on the account, at the\n account's spot taker fee on each market and with no other fee, protected by\n the end-to-end min_amount_out the caller accepts: each order's price limit\n covers the taker fee scheduled within its window, so any part that trades\n nets at least that rate, and anything that cannot stays on the account. An\n order the exchange first accepts after its window (only under severe\n delay) may pay a later scheduled fee; if that takes a fill below the rate,\n the Swap finishes with MINIMUM_NOT_MET. Quotes are estimates and reserve\n nothing.\n\n Requests are authenticated with a session token or a signed API key. The\n caller needs the SWAP permission on the account: the trading roles grant it\n on sub-accounts, and API keys and sub-account policies must include the SWAP\n action. A Swap's orders also remain subject to the sub-account's spot\n trading policy.\n\n Follow a Swap with GetSwap until is_terminal is true; a market Swap usually\n completes within seconds, a TWAP by its deadline.",
      "methods": [
        {
          "name": "CreateSwap",
          "path": "swap.v1.SwapService/CreateSwap",
          "requestType": "swap.v1.CreateSwapRequest",
          "responseType": "swap.v1.CreateSwapResponse",
          "summary": "Create Swap",
          "doc": "CreateSwap creates the Swap for idempotency_key and executes it at once.\n It re-prices the terms against current depth first: the Swap is created\n only while the quote is unexpired and min_amount_out_e18 is achievable.\n It is idempotent per caller and key: a repeated or concurrent request with\n the same body returns the same Swap, so every unknown outcome is resolved\n by repeating the request unchanged.\n\n Errors:\n - INVALID_ARGUMENT: malformed request, AMOUNT_OUT_OF_RANGE or\n   INVALID_SUBACCOUNT_ID.\n - FAILED_PRECONDITION: ROUTE_UNSUPPORTED, DIRECTION_UNSUPPORTED,\n   PROTECTION_UNACHIEVABLE, QUOTE_EXPIRED or SUBACCOUNT_INACTIVE; nothing is\n   created.\n - ALREADY_EXISTS: IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT; the original Swap stands.\n - NOT_FOUND: SUBACCOUNT_NOT_FOUND.\n - PERMISSION_DENIED: SWAP_NOT_PERMITTED.\n - UNAVAILABLE, DEADLINE_EXCEEDED: QUOTE_UNAVAILABLE, SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE\n   or an unknown outcome; retry the same request.\n - UNAUTHENTICATED: missing or invalid credentials.",
          "tags": [
            "trading"
          ],
          "authRequired": true,
          "authenticationMethods": [
            "session_token",
            "api_key"
          ],
          "mfaRequirement": "none",
          "stability": "stable",
          "errorProtoPkg": "swap.v1",
          "errorCatalog": "core:generic",
